### =========================================================================
### Auth API — Test Suite
### =========================================================================
### Requires: "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) VS Code extension
###          or JetBrains HTTP Client
###
### Matches server.ts:
###   - PORT = 5000 (from your boot banner)
###   - authRouter mounted at /api/auth
###   - CORS allows http://localhost:5173 + 4173 with credentials
###   - authLimiter = 10 req / 15 min on /api/auth  → negative tests will trip it, run them last
###   - apiLimiter  = 100 req / 15 min on /api/*
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/auth
@academicStructureUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/academic-structure
@contentType = application/json

### Prereqs — set once
@schoolId = 52426aab-497c-4880-8f8a-ad8a385f6e2b
@superAdminEmail = super@platform.test
@superAdminPassword = SuperSecret123
@classId = 1deeec22-8ddc-4f51-9458-5803a4e6d031




### Captured at runtime by earlier requests
@superAdminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6ImU1NTM3MzllLWFiNzAtNDQ1Yy1hNjY3LTFjNWZkZDljOWJiNSIsImVtYWlsIjoic3VwZXJAcGxhdGZvcm0udGVzdCIsInJvbGUiOiJzdXBlcl9hZG1pbiIsInJvbGVzIjpbInN1cGVyX2FkbWluIl0sInNjaG9vbElkIjpudWxsLCJpYXQiOjE3OTM1NDQwNzAsImV4cCI6MTc5NDE0ODg3MH0.SMh-PoP_MmPrJMpJWxmthxBIW5LLNJAsqDTPk_Q0r5U
@principalToken  = 
@principalUserId = {{principalLogin.response.body.$.user.id}}
@teacherUserId   = {{registerTeacher.response.body.$.user.id}}
@parentUserId    = {{registerParent.response.body.$.user.id}}
@studentUserId   = {{registerStudent.response.body.$.user.id}}
@studentId       = {{registerStudent.response.body.$.student.id}}
@resetToken      = {{forgotPassword.response.body.$.resetToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 1. REGISTRATION
### =========================================================================

### 1.1 Register Super Admin (bootstrap — only works once, no auth required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/super-admin
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Platform Owner",
  "email": "{{superAdminEmail}}",
  "phone": "+254700000000",
  "nationalId": "12345678",
  "password": "{{superAdminPassword}}"
}


### 1.2 Register School Admin (requires super_admin token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/school-admin
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{superAdminToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "School Admin",
  "email": "admin1@school.test",
  "phone": "+254711111111",
  "nationalId": "87654322",
  "password": "SchoolAdmin123",
  "roles":["principal"]
}


### 1.3 Register School Member — Teacher (requires schoolManagementAuth token)
# @name registerTeacher
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/member
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "Jane Teacher",
  "email": "jane.teacher@school.test",
  "phone": "+254722222222",
  "nationalId": "11112222",
  "tscNumber": "TSC-001",
  "role": "teacher",
  "password": "TeacherPass123"
}


### 1.4 Register School Member — Bursar
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/member
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "Bill Bursar",
  "email": "bill.bursar@school.test",
  "phone": "+254733333333",
  "role": "bursar",
  "password": "BursarPass123"
}


### 1.5 Register School Member — Student
### NOTE: firstName, lastName, admissionNumber are now REQUIRED when role = "student"
# @name registerStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/member
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "Sam Student",
  "email": "sam1.student@school.test",
  "admissionNumber": "ADM-2026-001",
  "role": "student",
  "password": "StudentPass123",
  "firstName": "Sam",
  "lastName": "Student",
  "gender": "Male",
  "dateOfBirth": "2014-05-12"
}


### 1.5b Register Student with a class at admission (creates enrollment history too)
# @name registerStudentWithClass
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/member
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "Mary Learner",
  "email": "mary.learner@school.test",
  "admissionNumber": "ADM-2025-002",
  "role": "student",
  "password": "LearnerPass123",
  "firstName": "Mary",
  "lastName": "Learner",
  "gender": "Female",
  "dateOfBirth": "2013-07-22",
  "classId": "{{classId}}"
}


### 1.6 Register School Member — Parent
# @name registerParent
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/member
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "Pat Parent",
  "email": "pat.parent@school.test",
  "phone": "+254744444444",
  "role": "parent",
  "password": "ParentPass123"
}


### =========================================================================
### 2. LOGIN / SESSIONS
### =========================================================================

### 2.1 Login — Super Admin
# @name superAdminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "pat.parent@school.test",
  "password": "ParentPass123"
}


### 2.2 Login — Principal (adjust credentials to a real principal you created)
# @name principalLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "admin1@school.test",
  "password": "SchoolAdmin123",
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}"
}


### 2.3 Login — Teacher by email
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "jane.teacher@school.test",
  "password": "TeacherPass123",
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}"
}


### 2.4 Login — Student by admission number
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "ADM-2025-001",
  "password": "StudentPass123",
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}"
}


### 2.5 Login — wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "{{superAdminEmail}}",
  "password": "definitely-wrong"
}


### 2.6 Logout current session
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{superAdminToken}}

{}


### 2.7 Logout all sessions for current user
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout-all
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{}


### 2.8 List my active sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 3. PASSWORD / PROFILE
### =========================================================================

### 3.1 Forgot password — request reset link
# @name forgotPassword
POST {{baseUrl}}/forgot-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "jane.teacher@school.test"
}


### 3.2 Reset password using token from 3.1
POST {{baseUrl}}/reset-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "resetToken": "{{resetToken}}",
  "newPassword": "NewTeacherPass456"
}


### 3.3 Change password — current user
POST {{baseUrl}}/change-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "oldPassword": "PrincipalPass123",
  "newPassword": "NewPrincipalPass456"
}


### 3.4 Get own profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}


### 3.5 Get profile by user ID (admin viewing another user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile/{{teacherUserId}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}


### 3.6 Update own profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profile
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{superAdminToken}}

{
  "roles": "principal"
}


### 3.7 Update profile by ID (admin editing another user)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profile/{{teacherUserId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "name": "Jane Teacher Updated",
  "tscNumber": "TSC-001-UPDATED"
}


### =========================================================================
### 4. ADMIN ACTIONS
### =========================================================================

### 4.1 List users in a school (all roles)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/users
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}


### 4.2 List users in a school — filter by role
GET {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/users?role=teacher
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}


### 4.3 List users in a school — filter by role (parents)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schools/{{schoolId}}/users?role=parent
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}


### 4.4 Deactivate a user
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{teacherUserId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "isActive": false
}


### 4.5 Reactivate a user
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{teacherUserId}}/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "isActive": true
}


### =========================================================================
### 5. GUARDIAN ↔ STUDENT LINKS
### =========================================================================

### 5.1 Link a parent to a student
POST {{baseUrl}}/guardian-links
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "guardianUserId": "{{parentUserId}}",
  "relationship": "Father",
  "isPrimary": true,
  "isFeePayer": true,
  "canPickup": true
}


### 5.2 Link a second guardian (mother, non-primary)
POST {{baseUrl}}/guardian-links
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "guardianUserId": "{{parentUserId}}",
  "relationship": "Mother",
  "isPrimary": false,
  "isFeePayer": false,
  "canPickup": true
}


### 5.3 List guardians for a student
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/guardians
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}


### 5.4 Unlink a guardian from a student
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/guardian-links
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "guardianUserId": "{{parentUserId}}"
}


### 5.5 Link the freshly registered student to a class (academic-structure module)
### Proves the register → link pipeline works end-to-end.
### Prereq: @studentId and @classId point at real rows in the same school.
POST {{academicStructureUrl}}/classes/link-student
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "classId": "{{classId}}",
  "requireUnplaced": true
}


### =========================================================================
### 6. MULTI-ROLE SANITY CHECK (Option A)
### =========================================================================

### 6.1 Login as the multi-role principal
# The returned JWT should include "roles": ["school_admin","principal"]
# after you promote that user in the DB.
# @name multiRoleLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "principal@school.test",
  "password": "PrincipalPass123",
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}"
}


### 6.2 Use the multi-role token to register a member (should succeed via schoolManagementAuth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/member
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{multiRoleLogin.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "Multi Role Test Teacher",
  "email": "multi.role.teacher@school.test",
  "role": "teacher",
  "password": "TeacherPass123"
}


### =========================================================================
### 7. NEGATIVE / AUTH TESTS
### =========================================================================
### ⚠️ RUN THESE LAST — authLimiter is 10 req / 15 min on /api/auth.
###    Each request below counts. If you've already burned the quota
###    doing sections 1–6, wait 15 minutes or restart the server.

### 7.1 No token — expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### 7.2 Bad token — expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Cookie: token=not-a-real-token


### 7.3 Malformed cookie — expect 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout-all
Cookie: token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.invalid.signature


### 7.4 Missing required fields — expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "test@test.com"
}


### 7.5 Invalid UUID in route param — expect 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/not-a-uuid/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "isActive": false
}


### 7.6 Invalid guardian relationship value — expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/guardian-links
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "guardianUserId": "{{parentUserId}}",
  "relationship": "Uncle"
}


### 7.7 Unknown school on login — expect 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "identifier": "{{superAdminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{superAdminPassword}}",
  "schoolId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}


### 7.8 Register student missing firstName — expect 400
### Exercises the new refine on registerSchoolMemberSchema
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/member
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "No First Name",
  "email": "nofirst@school.test",
  "admissionNumber": "ADM-2025-099",
  "role": "student",
  "password": "StudentPass123",
  "lastName": "Student"
}


### 7.9 Register student missing admissionNumber — expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/register/member
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: token={{principalToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "No Admission",
  "email": "noadm@school.test",
  "role": "student",
  "password": "StudentPass123",
  "firstName": "No",
  "lastName": "Admission"
}


### =========================================================================
### 8. HEALTH CHECK (root, NOT under /api/auth)
### =========================================================================
### Just to confirm the server is up. Uses apiLimiter, not authLimiter.

GET http://localhost:5000/